+# Version numbering scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver) for version numbers, because semver gives users clearer signals about compatibility when we update. This decision comes from a recorded session statement rather than a committed or otherwise confirmed change, so it should be re-confirmed before anything depends on it.
